{"id":"forecast-05","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-05/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":399.67,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.92,"text":"You will hear the chairperson of the Middletown Urban Farming Scheme talking to a group of people","words":[["You",0.0,0.32],["will",0.32,0.48],["hear",0.48,0.68],["the",0.68,0.84],["chairperson",0.84,1.58],["of",1.58,1.88],["the",1.88,2.02],["Middletown",2.02,2.54],["Urban",2.54,2.84],["Farming",2.84,3.48],["Scheme",3.48,3.92],["talking",3.92,4.66],["to",4.66,5.06],["a",5.06,5.24],["group",5.24,5.36],["of",5.36,5.6],["people",5.6,5.92]]},{"start":5.92,"end":12.42,"text":"who are interested in joining the scheme. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["who",5.92,6.42],["are",6.42,6.54],["interested",6.54,6.96],["in",6.96,7.28],["joining",7.28,7.64],["the",7.64,7.9],["scheme.",7.9,8.24],["First,",9.58,10.26],["you",10.6,10.8],["have",10.8,10.96],["some",10.96,11.16],["time",11.16,11.52],["to",11.52,11.76],["look",11.76,11.88],["at",11.88,12.02],["questions",12.02,12.42]]},{"start":12.42,"end":65.48,"text":"11 to 16 on page 3. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.","words":[["11",12.42,13.3],["to",13.3,13.8],["16",13.8,14.3],["on",14.3,14.94],["page",14.94,15.18],["3.",15.18,15.66],["Now",61.34,61.66],["listen",61.66,61.98],["carefully",61.98,62.44],["and",62.44,62.94],["answer",62.94,63.2],["questions",63.2,63.68],["11",63.68,64.48],["to",64.48,65.0],["16.",65.0,65.48]]},{"start":68.94,"end":74.1,"text":"I'm Chris Butler and I'm the chairperson of the Middletown Urban Farming Scheme,","words":[["I'm",68.94,69.58],["Chris",69.58,69.74],["Butler",69.74,70.08],["and",70.08,70.76],["I'm",70.76,70.96],["the",70.96,71.04],["chairperson",71.04,71.68],["of",71.68,71.92],["the",71.92,72.02],["Middletown",72.02,72.5],["Urban",72.5,72.78],["Farming",72.78,73.26],["Scheme,",73.26,74.1]]},{"start":74.1,"end":80.34,"text":"or MUFS for short, a highly successful program which encourages city dwellers to grow their","words":[["or",74.1,74.38],["MUFS",74.38,75.0],["for",75.0,75.34],["short,",75.34,75.58],["a",76.36,76.46],["highly",76.46,76.72],["successful",76.72,77.16],["program",77.16,77.76],["which",77.76,78.14],["encourages",78.14,78.78],["city",78.78,79.08],["dwellers",79.08,79.56],["to",79.56,79.94],["grow",79.94,80.18],["their",80.18,80.34]]},{"start":80.34,"end":88.18,"text":"own fruit and vegetables, to become city farmers, if you will. Who started MUFS? Well, the idea","words":[["own",80.34,80.48],["fruit",80.48,80.68],["and",80.68,80.82],["vegetables,",80.82,81.24],["to",81.78,81.92],["become",81.92,82.24],["city",82.24,82.68],["farmers,",82.68,83.12],["if",83.3,83.4],["you",83.4,83.5],["will.",83.5,83.68],["Who",84.68,84.92],["started",84.92,85.32],["MUFS?",85.32,86.04],["Well,",86.98,87.22],["the",87.62,87.72],["idea",87.72,88.18]]},{"start":88.18,"end":92.96,"text":"of urban farming has been around for quite a while, particularly among town planners.","words":[["of",88.18,88.52],["urban",88.52,88.84],["farming",88.84,89.38],["has",89.38,89.7],["been",89.7,89.88],["around",89.88,90.18],["for",90.18,90.36],["quite",90.36,90.6],["a",90.6,90.7],["while,",90.7,90.98],["particularly",91.36,91.84],["among",91.84,92.18],["town",92.18,92.56],["planners.",92.56,92.96]]},{"start":93.92,"end":97.86,"text":"But it was actually a group of Middletown business people, including myself,","words":[["But",93.92,94.22],["it",94.22,94.28],["was",94.28,94.4],["actually",94.4,94.72],["a",94.72,94.88],["group",94.88,95.02],["of",95.02,95.22],["Middletown",95.22,95.78],["business",95.78,96.14],["people,",96.14,96.64],["including",97.02,97.36],["myself,",97.36,97.86]]},{"start":97.86,"end":101.16,"text":"involved, who decided to create what became MUFS.","words":[["involved,",97.86,98.0],["who",98.28,98.78],["decided",98.78,99.14],["to",99.14,99.36],["create",99.36,99.64],["what",99.64,99.86],["became",99.86,100.28],["MUFS.",100.28,101.16]]},{"start":102.06,"end":105.24,"text":"University agriculture specialists got involved later.","words":[["University",102.06,102.56],["agriculture",102.56,103.2],["specialists",103.2,103.96],["got",103.96,104.58],["involved",104.58,104.84],["later.",104.84,105.24]]},{"start":106.16,"end":112.66,"text":"Now, initially, the aim was not some eco-friendly goal of reducing CO2 emissions caused by the","words":[["Now,",106.16,106.44],["initially,",106.6,106.96],["the",107.6,107.74],["aim",107.74,107.98],["was",107.98,108.16],["not",108.16,108.42],["some",108.42,108.72],["eco",108.72,109.12],["-friendly",109.12,109.48],["goal",109.48,109.9],["of",109.9,110.14],["reducing",110.14,110.5],["CO2",110.5,111.2],["emissions",111.2,111.74],["caused",111.74,112.14],["by",112.14,112.5],["the",112.5,112.66]]},{"start":112.66,"end":115.0,"text":"transport of food from farm to dinner plate.","words":[["transport",112.66,113.18],["of",113.18,113.44],["food",113.44,113.74],["from",113.74,114.04],["farm",114.04,114.34],["to",114.34,114.5],["dinner",114.5,114.72],["plate.",114.72,115.0]]},{"start":115.68,"end":121.22,"text":"It was simply to maximize the utilization of the vacant or idle land that lies within","words":[["It",115.68,116.1],["was",116.1,116.2],["simply",116.2,116.54],["to",116.54,116.72],["maximize",116.72,117.14],["the",117.14,117.66],["utilization",117.66,118.08],["of",118.08,118.86],["the",118.86,118.96],["vacant",118.96,119.3],["or",119.3,119.5],["idle",119.5,119.8],["land",119.8,120.24],["that",120.24,120.58],["lies",120.58,120.88],["within",120.88,121.22]]},{"start":121.22,"end":121.64,"text":"the city.","words":[["the",121.22,121.42],["city.",121.42,121.64]]},{"start":122.36,"end":127.84,"text":"Of course, later we realized that an additional benefit might be a healthier diet for low","words":[["Of",122.36,122.58],["course,",122.58,122.86],["later",123.26,123.58],["we",123.58,123.74],["realized",123.74,124.22],["that",124.22,124.58],["an",124.58,124.7],["additional",124.7,125.04],["benefit",125.04,125.6],["might",125.6,126.26],["be",126.26,126.5],["a",126.5,126.62],["healthier",126.62,126.96],["diet",126.96,127.48],["for",127.48,127.7],["low",127.7,127.84]]},{"start":127.84,"end":133.4,"text":"people. Let me tell you a bit about the groups that have joined the scheme. We've","words":[["people.",127.84,128.28],["Let",129.18,129.78],["me",129.78,129.92],["tell",129.92,130.18],["you",130.18,130.32],["a",130.32,130.46],["bit",130.46,130.52],["about",130.52,130.82],["the",130.82,131.0],["groups",131.0,131.32],["that",131.32,131.48],["have",131.48,131.58],["joined",131.58,131.86],["the",131.86,132.08],["scheme.",132.08,132.34],["We've",133.06,133.4]]},{"start":133.4,"end":138.26,"text":"got any number of schools involved and loads of corporate employees, so our","words":[["got",133.4,133.6],["any",133.6,133.92],["number",133.92,134.3],["of",134.3,134.44],["schools",134.44,134.74],["involved",134.74,135.28],["and",135.28,135.84],["loads",135.84,136.12],["of",136.12,136.32],["corporate",136.32,136.64],["employees,",136.64,137.26],["so",137.56,138.04],["our",138.04,138.26]]},{"start":138.26,"end":142.74,"text":"message seems to have been well received there. But for next year, we're gonna","words":[["message",138.26,138.66],["seems",138.66,139.0],["to",139.0,139.18],["have",139.18,139.32],["been",139.32,139.42],["well",139.42,139.68],["received",139.68,140.06],["there.",140.06,140.44],["But",140.96,141.32],["for",141.32,141.46],["next",141.46,141.64],["year,",141.64,141.98],["we're",142.32,142.58],["gonna",142.58,142.74]]},{"start":142.74,"end":146.78,"text":"concentrate on getting various community centers, like those for senior","words":[["concentrate",142.74,143.3],["on",143.3,143.58],["getting",143.58,143.76],["various",143.76,144.2],["community",144.2,144.66],["centers,",144.66,145.12],["like",145.68,145.94],["those",145.94,146.22],["for",146.22,146.48],["senior",146.48,146.78]]},{"start":146.78,"end":151.66,"text":"citizens to join, because so far they've been somewhat slow to take up the","words":[["citizens",146.78,147.32],["to",147.32,147.64],["join,",147.64,147.98],["because",148.36,148.74],["so",148.74,149.0],["far",149.0,149.38],["they've",149.38,150.0],["been",150.0,150.12],["somewhat",150.12,150.52],["slow",150.52,150.86],["to",150.86,151.02],["take",151.02,151.26],["up",151.26,151.46],["the",151.46,151.66]]},{"start":151.66,"end":160.26,"text":"scheme. Now, the core committee of the MUFS is a group of dedicated gardeners. They probably","words":[["scheme.",151.66,151.92],["Now,",152.9,153.54],["the",154.08,154.32],["core",154.32,154.62],["committee",154.62,155.1],["of",155.1,155.38],["the",155.38,155.5],["MUFS",155.5,156.2],["is",156.2,157.12],["a",157.12,157.26],["group",157.26,157.38],["of",157.38,157.6],["dedicated",157.6,158.0],["gardeners.",158.0,158.8],["They",159.48,159.8],["probably",159.8,160.26]]},{"start":160.26,"end":165.88,"text":"won't be familiar with your specific plot of land. They're mostly amateurs. But they","words":[["won't",160.26,160.64],["be",160.64,160.78],["familiar",160.78,161.3],["with",161.3,161.62],["your",161.62,161.76],["specific",161.76,162.18],["plot",162.18,162.56],["of",162.56,162.7],["land.",162.7,162.96],["They're",163.52,163.88],["mostly",163.88,164.14],["amateurs.",164.14,164.62],["But",165.26,165.66],["they",165.66,165.88]]},{"start":165.88,"end":170.86,"text":"are the people who know the ins and outs of gardening, and they will be happy to sit","words":[["are",165.88,166.04],["the",166.04,166.16],["people",166.16,166.46],["who",166.46,166.7],["know",166.7,166.94],["the",166.94,167.14],["ins",167.14,167.58],["and",167.58,167.76],["outs",167.76,168.1],["of",168.1,168.44],["gardening,",168.44,168.88],["and",169.16,169.74],["they",169.74,169.88],["will",169.88,170.02],["be",170.02,170.18],["happy",170.18,170.48],["to",170.48,170.64],["sit",170.64,170.86]]},{"start":170.86,"end":177.9,"text":"down with any MUFS member and make some hands-on suggestions about gardening. But don't expect","words":[["down",170.86,171.18],["with",171.18,171.38],["any",171.38,171.68],["MUFS",171.68,172.46],["member",172.46,172.82],["and",172.82,173.64],["make",173.64,173.84],["some",173.84,174.04],["hands",174.04,174.4],["-on",174.4,174.64],["suggestions",174.64,175.12],["about",175.12,175.54],["gardening.",175.54,175.98],["But",176.46,176.94],["don't",176.94,177.62],["expect",177.62,177.9]]},{"start":177.9,"end":182.4,"text":"them to know the answers to technical questions like the Latin names of plants.","words":[["them",177.9,178.14],["to",178.14,178.3],["know",178.3,178.52],["the",178.52,178.72],["answers",178.72,179.08],["to",179.08,179.42],["technical",179.42,179.96],["questions",179.96,180.52],["like",180.52,181.16],["the",181.16,181.3],["Latin",181.3,181.54],["names",181.54,182.0],["of",182.0,182.16],["plants.",182.16,182.4]]},{"start":183.46,"end":189.98,"text":"The MUFS are keen to support members who are physically disabled. We're looking at the","words":[["The",183.46,184.1],["MUFS",184.1,184.74],["are",184.74,185.46],["keen",185.46,185.76],["to",185.76,185.96],["support",185.96,186.26],["members",186.26,186.64],["who",186.64,186.98],["are",186.98,187.08],["physically",187.08,187.42],["disabled.",187.42,188.06],["We're",188.84,189.38],["looking",189.38,189.64],["at",189.64,189.86],["the",189.86,189.98]]},{"start":189.98,"end":195.3,"text":"possibility providing specially adapted gardening tools on loan to members who can't cope with","words":[["possibility",189.98,190.58],["providing",190.58,191.2],["specially",191.2,191.68],["adapted",191.68,192.2],["gardening",192.2,192.64],["tools",192.64,193.08],["on",193.08,193.38],["loan",193.38,193.54],["to",193.54,193.76],["members",193.76,194.04],["who",194.04,194.6],["can't",194.6,194.92],["cope",194.92,195.1],["with",195.1,195.3]]},{"start":195.3,"end":201.66,"text":"regular tools. That's not happening yet. But we do have some window boxes as well as larger","words":[["regular",195.3,195.62],["tools.",195.62,196.08],["That's",196.72,197.08],["not",197.08,197.22],["happening",197.22,197.64],["yet.",197.64,197.96],["But",198.42,198.76],["we",198.76,198.88],["do",198.88,199.08],["have",199.08,199.44],["some",199.44,199.78],["window",199.78,200.12],["boxes",200.12,200.58],["as",200.58,200.9],["well",200.9,201.12],["as",201.12,201.36],["larger",201.36,201.66]]},{"start":201.66,"end":207.28,"text":"containers which we can distribute free of charge to these members, although they will have to","words":[["containers",201.66,202.24],["which",202.24,202.98],["we",202.98,203.2],["can",203.2,203.4],["distribute",203.4,203.9],["free",203.9,204.22],["of",204.22,204.34],["charge",204.34,204.66],["to",204.66,204.88],["these",204.88,205.06],["members,",205.06,205.4],["although",205.92,206.38],["they",206.38,206.7],["will",206.7,206.92],["have",206.92,207.14],["to",207.14,207.28]]},{"start":207.28,"end":209.52,"text":"provide their own soil and compost themselves.","words":[["provide",207.28,207.54],["their",207.54,207.8],["own",207.8,207.98],["soil",207.98,208.3],["and",208.3,208.48],["compost",208.48,208.84],["themselves.",208.84,209.52]]},{"start":210.26,"end":215.5,"text":"I'm especially proud of the work we've done with the local schools, both grade school level","words":[["I'm",210.26,210.76],["especially",210.76,211.14],["proud",211.14,211.58],["of",211.58,211.8],["the",211.8,211.88],["work",211.88,212.1],["we've",212.1,212.36],["done",212.36,212.62],["with",212.62,212.88],["the",212.88,213.02],["local",213.02,213.26],["schools,",213.26,213.82],["both",214.44,214.6],["grade",214.6,214.9],["school",214.9,215.22],["level",215.22,215.5]]},{"start":215.5,"end":216.42,"text":"and high schools.","words":[["and",215.5,215.86],["high",215.86,216.06],["schools.",216.06,216.42]]},{"start":217.12,"end":221.26,"text":"The teachers say that they knew the scheme would be of some practical use in science","words":[["The",217.12,217.28],["teachers",217.28,217.54],["say",217.54,217.94],["that",217.94,218.2],["they",218.2,218.36],["knew",218.36,218.62],["the",218.62,218.82],["scheme",218.82,219.08],["would",219.08,219.26],["be",219.26,219.42],["of",219.42,219.52],["some",219.52,219.74],["practical",219.74,220.18],["use",220.18,220.56],["in",220.56,220.88],["science",220.88,221.26]]},{"start":221.26,"end":222.62,"text":"classes like biology.","words":[["classes",221.26,221.74],["like",221.74,222.1],["biology.",222.1,222.62]]},{"start":223.62,"end":228.58,"text":"Despite the original hopes of some, the fruit and vegetable plots haven't provided cheaper","words":[["Despite",223.62,223.92],["the",223.92,224.26],["original",224.26,224.54],["hopes",224.54,224.9],["of",224.9,225.06],["some,",225.06,225.36],["the",226.02,226.14],["fruit",226.14,226.4],["and",226.4,226.58],["vegetable",226.58,226.88],["plots",226.88,227.44],["haven't",227.44,227.8],["provided",227.8,228.16],["cheaper",228.16,228.58]]},{"start":228.58,"end":229.96,"text":"lunches for their students.","words":[["lunches",228.58,229.16],["for",229.16,229.34],["their",229.34,229.52],["students.",229.52,229.96]]},{"start":230.6,"end":235.5,"text":"But what they didn't anticipate was the change in attitude that the scheme has","words":[["But",230.6,230.92],["what",230.92,231.04],["they",231.04,231.24],["didn't",231.24,231.58],["anticipate",231.58,232.14],["was",232.14,232.96],["the",232.96,233.14],["change",233.14,233.6],["in",233.6,233.86],["attitude",233.86,234.38],["that",234.38,234.88],["the",234.88,235.0],["scheme",235.0,235.3],["has",235.3,235.5]]},{"start":235.5,"end":240.26,"text":"created amongst their students. They say the students have become much more conscious of","words":[["created",235.5,235.82],["amongst",235.82,236.12],["their",236.12,236.4],["students.",236.4,236.78],["They",237.64,237.82],["say",237.82,238.06],["the",238.06,238.26],["students",238.26,238.6],["have",238.6,238.76],["become",238.76,239.04],["much",239.04,239.38],["more",239.38,239.58],["conscious",239.58,240.02],["of",240.02,240.26]]},{"start":240.26,"end":243.62,"text":"their surrounding environment. They want to keep it neat and tidy.","words":[["their",240.26,240.4],["surrounding",240.4,240.76],["environment.",240.76,241.34],["They",241.96,242.24],["want",242.24,242.4],["to",242.4,242.54],["keep",242.54,242.72],["it",242.72,242.86],["neat",242.86,243.14],["and",243.14,243.34],["tidy.",243.34,243.62]]},{"start":247.28,"end":253.26,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 17-20","words":[["Before",247.28,247.56],["you",247.56,247.82],["hear",247.82,248.04],["the",248.04,248.2],["rest",248.2,248.48],["of",248.48,248.62],["the",248.62,248.72],["talk,",248.72,249.02],["you",249.46,249.64],["have",249.64,249.84],["some",249.84,250.06],["time",250.06,250.38],["to",250.38,250.6],["look",250.6,250.72],["at",250.72,250.88],["questions",250.88,251.28],["17",251.28,252.36],["-20",252.36,253.26]]},{"start":253.67,"end":279.08,"text":"on page 4. Now listen and answer questions 17-20.","words":[["on",253.67,253.96],["page",253.96,254.2],["4.",254.2,254.66],["Now",275.08,275.38],["listen",275.38,275.78],["and",275.78,276.38],["answer",276.38,276.66],["questions",276.66,277.12],["17",277.12,278.12],["-20.",278.12,279.08]]},{"start":282.57,"end":288.15,"text":"Now a number of local organizations and businesses provide our members with free goods and services.","words":[["Now",282.57,283.11],["a",283.11,283.27],["number",283.27,283.47],["of",283.47,283.63],["local",283.63,283.91],["organizations",283.91,284.75],["and",284.75,285.07],["businesses",285.07,285.53],["provide",285.53,285.99],["our",285.99,286.29],["members",286.29,286.61],["with",286.61,286.99],["free",286.99,287.25],["goods",287.25,287.57],["and",287.57,287.71],["services.",287.71,288.15]]},{"start":288.15,"end":293.93,"text":"houses. Let me go through some of them. The city hospital, as you might expect, has to","words":[["houses.",288.15,288.29],["Let",288.81,289.11],["me",289.11,289